<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Upgrades</strong> take effect immediately. The prorated difference is charged at once.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Downgrades</strong> take effect at your next renewal. You keep your current plan until then.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Plan changes are <strong>not refunded or credited</strong>.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Read the details on <a href="/plan-changes-refunds/">plan changes, domains and refunds</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></section>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","align":"full","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|60","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|60"}}},"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<section class="wp-block-group alignfull" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)"><!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">What you pay in total</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>Free plan:</strong> the 2% WopCart platform fee plus Stripe's processing fees.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>Paid plan:</strong> the yearly plan price plus your payment provider's processing fees. WopCart takes nothing from your transactions.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></section>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","align":"full","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|60","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|60"}}},"backgroundColor":"accent-5","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<section class="wp-block-group alignfull has-accent-5-background-color has-background" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)"><!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Pricing questions</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Are any features locked on the free plan?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>No. There are no locked features and no limits on products. The plan only decides how payments are routed.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Why is the free plan limited to Stripe and Apple Pay?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>PayPal, Authorize.net and 2Checkout provide no way to collect a platform fee, so they are available on paid plans, where you use your own credentials.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>What happens when my plan ends?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The store returns to the free plan. Features keep working, and payments are routed through WopCart's Stripe Connect platform with the 2% fee.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>What if the plan check cannot reach wopcart.com?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A site on a paid plan keeps its plan for up to 14 days while wopcart.com is unreachable, so an outage on our side does not add a fee to your sales.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details --></section>
<!-- /wp:group -->

